      "writtenOn": "2017-12-25T01:30:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "a valid input is like:\n\n{\n   \"roles\": [\n        {\"id\": xxx},\n        {\"name\": admin}\n   ] \n}\n\nyou mean it could be like this?\n\n{\n   \"roles\": [\n        {\"id\": admin\u0027s id,\n         \"name\": admin}\n   ] \n}\n\nI think it\u0027s a little redundant.",
      "parentUuid": "bf8cb3f7_4ccb8771",
